{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"talkable-marmatite-agouti","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe src/rebar/review_bot cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/__init__.py:1-17` — Preserve the package's current responsibility. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/adapter.py:1-37, 76-83, 260-273, 311-324, 404-415` — Preserve verdict-to-label mapping, retryable-gap taxonomy, tree/revision binding, and fail-closed results. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/app.py:1-29, 65-73, 85-106, 165-172, 214-242, 255-274, 303-314, 327-338, 371-410, 484-488, 502-526, 534-543, 612-614` — Preserve authentication, queue/drain bounds, stale-revision checks, and endpoint contracts. Consumer: FastAPI/OpenAPI for the health and webhook endpoint contracts.\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:1-20, 35-77, 132-186, 204-210, 244-249, 292-309` — Preserve timeout relationships, logging setup, and cursor/retry bounds. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:1-29, 50-52, 120-147` — Preserve inline-versus-message publishing and bounded rendering. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:1-20, 42-56, 167-175, 193-199, 296-309, 447-454` — Preserve authenticated REST, cold-clone timeout, merge-delta API semantics, vote payload, and tickets-branch fetch. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/low_disk.py:1-27` — Preserve the two admission conditions and shared `low-disk` routing reason; reduce the incident and hypothetical-new-reason walkthrough. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/reconcile.py:1-51, 75-105, 148-179, 211-232, 268-323, 397-452` — Preserve low-water cursor, owed-vote statuses, cooperative shutdown, and no-vote recovery. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/retrigger.py:1-35, 51-79, 115-124, 185-197, 256-273, 308-313, 426-430` — Preserve trigger matching, eligibility, neutral-reset verification, and the attestation-only exception. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/review_bot/voter.py:1-22, 64-92, 175-178, 616-623, 701-715, 727-730, 771-783` — Preserve single-flight, in-flight accounting, merge routing, pre-vote staleness, terminal closed-change handling, and off-loop artifact recording. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"84f2-67b7-9d06-4a7e","parent_id":"d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in src/rebar/review_bot"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788570907353215547,"uuid":"6bdaad9f-1d02-40f7-9009-b6ad74a329b1"}